5
00:00:18.773 --> 00:00:22.556
SMART goal. Say it with me. SMART goal!

6
00:00:26.096 --> 00:00:29.829
Milestone. Say it with me. Milestone!

7
00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:37.467
Action plan. Say it with me. Action plan!

8
00:00:40.918 --> 00:00:44.984
Accountability. Say it with me. Accountability!

9
00:00:48.539 --> 00:00:52.272
Motivation. Say it with me. Motivation!

10
00:00:55.707 --> 00:01:00.073
Progress tracker. Say it with me. Progress tracker!

11
00:01:03.631 --> 00:01:07.064
Obstacle. Say it with me. Obstacle!

12
00:01:10.556 --> 00:01:14.123
Achievement. Say it with me. Achievement!

13
00:01:17.593 --> 00:01:22.293
Long-term vision. Say it with me. Long-term vision!

14
