17
00:01:47.292 --> 00:01:56.144
Grammar time! Future perfect. Listen. By next year, I will have achieved this goal.

18
00:01:56.194 --> 00:02:01.824
Your turn. Say it with me. By next year, I will have achieved this goal.

19
00:02:06.681 --> 00:02:15.015
Setting a SMART goal with clear milestones keeps me accountable. Tracking progress and staying motivated helps me overcome obstacles.

20
00:02:15.065 --> 00:02:16.468
I like this story!

21
00:02:17.713 --> 00:02:22.844
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:22.894 --> 00:02:24.094
Action plan!

23
00:02:25.294 --> 00:02:30.466
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:30.516 --> 00:02:31.666
Obstacle!

25
00:02:32.644 --> 00:02:40.948
Think and answer. What is one SMART goal you have set for yourself?

26
00:02:40.998 --> 00:02:42.148
Great answer!

27
